  "prefLabel": "Fam 301.05 Co-mediation",
  "priorExpiration": "2018-10-01",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fam 301.05 “Co-mediation” means mediation performed jointly by an intern or a certified family mediator and either a certified family mediator or a mediator currently approved by a CRO as an advanced practitioner or advanced educator member.\n\nSource. #5609, eff 4-6-93, EXPIRED: 4-6-99\n\nNew. #7716, INTERIM, eff 6-22-02, EXPIRED: 12-19-02\n\nNew. #7917, eff 7-11-03; ss by #8719, eff 11-1-06; ss by #8930, eff 7-4-07; ss by #9674, eff 4-2-10 (formerly Mar 301.06); ss by #12507, INTERIM, eff 4-2-18, EXPIRED: 10-1-18\n\nNew. #12634, eff 10-2-18",
